CLAIM C_BOOK_REGISTRY STATUS VERIFIED_COMPUTATION TEXT "Book operator and evidence-state registries are deterministically extracted from retained Book of Books source files."
BOUNDARY BookOfBooks.Registry CLAIM_CEILING VERIFIED_COMPUTATION REASON "Registry compilation preserves source vocabulary; it does not promote any generated hypothesis into truth."